flowchart TD
    A[Install MultiChain 2.3.3 on Windows] --> B[Create fakenews chain]
    B --> C[Start node and check getinfo]
    C --> D[Inspect existing streams]
    D --> E{news_records exists?}
    E -->|No| F[Create write-restricted news_records stream]
    E -->|Yes| G[Reuse existing stream]
    F --> H[Subscribe to stream]
    G --> H
    H --> J[Python reads local JSON-RPC config]
    J --> K[Python submits JSON metadata with article ID key]
    K --> L[MultiChain publishes transaction]
    L --> M[Wait for block confirmation]
    M --> N[Retrieve item by stream key]
    N --> O[Compare SHA-256 of local article with stored hash]
    O --> P{Match and confirmed?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Report integrity verified]
    P -->|No| R[Report tamper or pending state]
